Subject: [PATCH] feat(gardener): executor + deterministic IDs

Adds lib/gardener/executor.ts (idempotent approveAndRun: claim -> ensureVm ->
startRun fullAuto -> terminal -> completed/failed) + runtime.ts (production deps
wiring, singleton, test hook); deterministic proposal IDs (SHA-256, prop_ prefix);
gardener route approve path now actually executes (was status-only).

Reconciled the approve/dismiss route hunk against the live base, which uses a
string-type guard for proposalId. The approve path now calls approveAndRun;
dismiss still calls setProposalStatus.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
